Origin
------
XDock is a fork of Dash to Dock, the GNOME Shell dock by Michele Gaio and its
contributors:

  https://github.com/micheleg/dash-to-dock

It is based on upstream commit 248d42bb64c5e4d21203562f2ef68baf8c9ff083
(February 2026), whose history this repository keeps unchanged, so every
upstream line keeps its author there. Dash to Dock is licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 or (at your option) any later version.

The changes since that commit — the launcher and its drawers, the dock motion,
the GNOME Shell 50 port, the libadwaita preferences and the XDock name — are
copyright 2026 Spencer Norton, under the same licence.

