Artwork
-------
Every file in media/, with its author and licence. None is traced from, or
contains, third-party or commercial artwork.

- media/logo.svg: the Dash to Dock logo, drawn by Michele Gaio (2015),
  GPL-2.0-or-later. XDock changes only the name on it, which reads "XDock"
  instead of "Dash to Dock"; the author credit on the logo, "Michele", is
  unchanged.
- media/glossy.svg: the glossy running-indicator backlight, by Sven Hagemann
  (2017), GPL-2.0-or-later.
- media/highlight_stacked_bg.svg and media/highlight_stacked_bg_h.svg: the
  "metro" indicator backgrounds, by Michele Gaio (2017), GPL-2.0-or-later.

Translations
------------
The catalogues in po/ are Dash to Dock's, by the translators named in each
file's header, GPL-2.0-or-later. XDock changed only the product name in them.

